Pivot uses top-left pixel coordinates, stable across every cel. The main-body footprint is the placement reference, not the changing silhouette bounds. Unity normalized pivot uses (x/512, 1-y/512), because Unity uses bottom-left coordinates. Keep atlas rects untrimmed. Enable alpha transparency and clamp wrap; use the JSON variable frame durations.

